<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan shares via Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan shares via Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday reflected a net buying stance, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 8.0 million shares of sell orders against 8.5 million of buys.</p>
</text>
